## elaborations.soar -- thor-soar: 9 elaborations.

## Elaborate evaluate-operator state look-adhead-operator duplicate close-open-go -> sets duplicate-look-ahead-operator.
## BUG!
## Close-container and open-container
sp {evaluate-operator*elaborate*state*look-adhead-operator*duplicate*close-open-go
   :default
   (state <s> ^name evaluate-operator
             -^applied-lookahead true
              ^operator <operator> +
              ^look-ahead-operator <look-ahead-operator>)
   (<operator> ^name { << break-object clean-object close-container dirty-object  empty-object go-to get-object open-container slice-object turn-off turn-on toast >> <name> }
               ^argument1.object-handle <object-handle>)
   (<look-ahead-operator> ^name <name>
                          ^argument1.object-handle <object-handle>)
-->
   (<s> ^duplicate-look-ahead-operator <operator>)}

