## Elaborate evaluate-operator world initialize-room -> sets room-name.
sp {evaluate-operator*elaborate*world*initialize-room
   :default
   (state <s> ^deep-copy-world true
              ^world <new-world>)
   (<new-world> ^duplicate-of <world>)
   (<world> ^room-name <room>)
-->
   (<new-world> ^room-name <room>)}
